WEBVTT

00:00:05.810 --> 00:00:09.320
Melheis stopped time one second after his death.

00:00:09.320 --> 00:00:12.070
He can be revived so long
as that state continues,

00:00:12.360 --> 00:00:15.160
but are you prepared to use
that magical power as your chip?

00:00:15.360 --> 00:00:18.240
You sure about that?
Not staking my life?

00:00:18.490 --> 00:00:24.120
If you're assuming that's a cheap chip,
then you're already under my spell.

00:00:24.460 --> 00:00:27.540
Interesting.
I'm going to strip you bare.

00:01:58.630 --> 00:02:01.220
Now then,
let me explain the rules.

00:01:58.800 --> 00:02:01.760
02 - The Demon King’s Duel of Intellect

00:02:01.220 --> 00:02:04.850
You will tell me who you believe
to be the Child of God.

00:02:05.140 --> 00:02:08.350
I will confirm whether it's true or not.

00:02:08.640 --> 00:02:12.610
However, I can be untruthful with you just once.

00:02:12.730 --> 00:02:13.860
Hmm.

00:02:13.860 --> 00:02:16.860
You can make up to eighteen guesses.

00:02:17.150 --> 00:02:19.660
If you guess right, you win.

00:02:19.660 --> 00:02:22.950
My magical power will then be sealed
for five seconds.

00:02:22.950 --> 00:02:24.490
On the other hand, if I win...

00:02:25.160 --> 00:02:28.750
You won't be able to use
your magical power for five seconds.

00:02:28.960 --> 00:02:30.500
And it goes without saying, but...

00:02:30.500 --> 00:02:33.540
One: you cannot ask the same question twice.

00:02:33.540 --> 00:02:37.130
Two: We cannot attack each other during this match.

00:02:37.130 --> 00:02:40.010
Three: If you forfeit, you lose.

00:02:40.010 --> 00:02:42.260
What do you say, Demon King Anos?

00:02:42.390 --> 00:02:45.060
Let me change one of those rules.

00:02:45.060 --> 00:02:46.020
Change it how?

00:02:46.390 --> 00:02:47.930
Just nine guesses is enough for me.

00:02:49.310 --> 00:02:52.020
But that would only put you at a disadvantage.

00:02:52.020 --> 00:02:53.440
What are you scheming?

00:02:53.690 --> 00:02:57.230
I thought I'd make this as fair a fight as possible.

00:02:57.780 --> 00:03:00.360
No amount of artificial advantages
can ever be enough for you.

00:03:00.530 --> 00:03:02.990
After all,
I am the one you're taking on.

00:03:04.740 --> 00:03:06.330
Fine, then.

00:03:06.580 --> 00:03:07.950
Zecht, please.

00:03:07.950 --> 00:03:09.040
Zecht.

00:03:11.210 --> 00:03:13.830
All right, let the game begin!

00:03:16.840 --> 00:03:21.260
My lord has commanded me
to seize your source.

00:03:22.680 --> 00:03:23.390
Why?

00:03:25.550 --> 00:03:27.850
Is this your doing?

00:03:29.890 --> 00:03:32.600
Tell me, why do you need Misa's source?

00:03:32.600 --> 00:03:36.730
Because she is the child borne by
the Great Spirit Leno.

00:03:37.900 --> 00:03:42.570
Your Source contains the power
to control all Spirits.

00:03:42.860 --> 00:03:45.450
The Great Spirit Leno?

00:03:45.450 --> 00:03:50.200
Then tell us how you came
to have half of that Magic Sword.

00:03:54.290 --> 00:03:55.630
What do you think?

00:03:55.750 --> 00:04:00.760
The spells I studied resemble Asc
and Jerga, eh?

00:04:01.010 --> 00:04:02.340
Just for the record...

00:04:10.060 --> 00:04:12.310
I happen to really hate that magic.

00:04:12.480 --> 00:04:17.520
Are you aware that the gods had
a hand in your birth?

00:04:17.520 --> 00:04:19.280
You're talking about how
the gods helped Jerga?

00:04:19.400 --> 00:04:22.440
That's right.
To create a vessel.

00:04:22.440 --> 00:04:27.370
They've been waiting all this time for a vessel
strong enough to carry the power of the gods.

00:04:27.660 --> 00:04:30.290
And guess who was born?

00:04:31.700 --> 00:04:37.960
How interesting. I can't wait to dissect you
and get a good look!

00:04:38.460 --> 00:04:43.090
I get it now.
You're someone I can never forgive.

00:04:44.380 --> 00:04:45.800
What do you want with us?

00:04:45.970 --> 00:04:49.810
You two were brought forth
by a god's intentions.

00:04:51.020 --> 00:04:52.680
What does that mean, exactly?

00:04:52.680 --> 00:04:56.270
When your source was split into two...

00:04:56.600 --> 00:05:00.440
...a personality was born; one
that never should've come into existence.

00:05:01.110 --> 00:05:02.740
That's me.

00:05:04.110 --> 00:05:06.030
There was no divine intent there.

00:05:11.240 --> 00:05:13.580
You think that was just a coincidence?

00:05:13.580 --> 00:05:16.500
It was the gods who rewrote the magic circle.

00:05:16.500 --> 00:05:19.840
But there's no need for divine intervention
in the Infernal Realm.

00:05:19.840 --> 00:05:22.050
I'll dispose of you when you awaken.

00:05:22.210 --> 00:05:24.970
I see.
Thanks for letting us know.

00:05:24.970 --> 00:05:26.840
But you're wrong.

00:05:27.470 --> 00:05:29.970
The one who brought us to life...

00:05:29.970 --> 00:05:33.850
...wasn't actually any god!

00:05:36.850 --> 00:05:40.980
<i>Among my subordinates, these are
the four who could be the Child of God.</i>

00:05:41.570 --> 00:05:43.610
<i>I'm going to base
my guesses on them.</i>

00:05:44.240 --> 00:05:45.820
Here's my first guess.

00:05:46.950 --> 00:05:48.910
The Child of God is one
of my subordinates.

00:05:49.160 --> 00:05:50.120
Correct.

00:05:51.700 --> 00:05:55.200
<i>That's the answer I expected,
but it could be a lie.</i>

00:05:55.910 --> 00:05:57.670
<i>To clarify...</i>

00:05:58.000 --> 00:05:59.710
The Child of God is Misha.

00:05:59.710 --> 00:06:01.130
Wrong.

00:06:01.420 --> 00:06:03.170
The child of God is Sasha.

00:06:03.170 --> 00:06:04.590
Wrong.

00:06:04.880 --> 00:06:06.670
The Child of God is Zeshia.

00:06:06.670 --> 00:06:08.050
Wrong.

00:06:08.380 --> 00:06:10.180
The Child of God is Misa.

00:06:10.180 --> 00:06:11.430
Correct.

00:06:11.970 --> 00:06:13.310
How strange.

00:06:13.640 --> 00:06:17.230
You seem to have given me
the answer on my fifth guess.

00:06:17.230 --> 00:06:21.730
It wouldn't be a battle of wits if it
were predictable, would it, Demon King Anos?

00:06:25.230 --> 00:06:25.940
I'm behind you.

00:06:28.280 --> 00:06:29.110
Lay!

00:06:29.410 --> 00:06:33.120
Magic Shield Gennias.
That which curses those who wound its owner,

00:06:33.120 --> 00:06:35.490
and inflicts twice the pain.

00:06:35.490 --> 00:06:39.580
Unless you destroy this shield, the curse can never
be lifted, nor can you ever recover.

00:06:39.710 --> 00:06:41.920
Really?
I just have to destroy it, then?

00:06:45.380 --> 00:06:46.590
I lied!

00:06:50.760 --> 00:06:54.050
I see that you tend to be too honest.

00:06:54.470 --> 00:06:56.560
His source has been destroyed.

00:06:56.970 --> 00:06:59.350
He won't be getting up ever again.

00:07:10.610 --> 00:07:12.200
The people from the castle.

00:07:13.490 --> 00:07:14.910
They're Gools!

00:07:15.030 --> 00:07:20.460
With the help of the Scarlet Monument King,
I modified the Igrams that Anos created.

00:07:20.660 --> 00:07:24.840
They're so powerful that your sources
will rot to the core.

00:07:25.630 --> 00:07:27.670
This magic is deplorable.

00:07:31.130 --> 00:07:32.180
Better not!

00:07:36.100 --> 00:07:38.430
<i>Sorry, you guys.
I'm going to save you, no matter what!</i>

00:07:44.650 --> 00:07:46.070
It's got to be here somewhere!

00:07:48.400 --> 00:07:52.530
Found it! If we destroy that,
no more Gools will ever be born!

00:08:00.250 --> 00:08:03.080
Laos... Heine...

00:08:03.370 --> 00:08:04.790
Ledriano...

00:08:05.630 --> 00:08:07.590
Don't give them another thought.

00:08:07.750 --> 00:08:12.130
I'll see to it that you never feel any grief again.

00:08:12.340 --> 00:08:15.140
Jino Gleanus.

00:08:22.980 --> 00:08:25.900
My magical power's being sucked away!

00:08:27.770 --> 00:08:32.440
Once I've drained your magical power,
that'll be the end for you!

00:08:35.320 --> 00:08:36.780
What is that?

00:08:37.780 --> 00:08:40.870
She's using Najira to hide its magical power.

00:08:42.830 --> 00:08:43.500
Jump!

00:08:46.920 --> 00:08:48.750
All the way from over there?
But how?

00:08:48.960 --> 00:08:51.050
The Boundless Sword, Garmest.

00:08:51.050 --> 00:08:53.050
It will do whatever I want.

00:08:55.340 --> 00:08:56.640
Ice Castle.

00:09:03.980 --> 00:09:07.060
Take that!
Jio Graze!

00:09:17.660 --> 00:09:18.410
To your right!

00:09:20.620 --> 00:09:21.740
Too bad for you!

00:09:21.910 --> 00:09:22.620
Stop!

00:09:22.830 --> 00:09:23.700
What?

00:09:26.710 --> 00:09:29.670
Garmest can take any form
in any number I wish.

00:09:29.670 --> 00:09:31.960
I set that up in advance, you see.

00:09:46.560 --> 00:09:49.650
Now I've sealed those annoying
Demonic Eyes of Destruction.

00:10:04.910 --> 00:10:07.500
Sasha...

00:10:07.790 --> 00:10:10.500
Concerned about your sister
at a time like this?

00:10:10.500 --> 00:10:12.000
What a brave soul.

00:10:13.050 --> 00:10:16.050
<i>He's confirmed that
"the Child of God is Misa" is correct.</i>

00:10:16.470 --> 00:10:18.930
<i>If Ziek used his right to lie for that,</i>

00:10:18.930 --> 00:10:20.800
<i>then none of the four can be the Child of God...</i>

00:10:22.810 --> 00:10:26.180
<i>But that would contradict what he said about
the Child of God being my subordinate.</i>

00:10:26.520 --> 00:10:29.900
<i>If Ziek just lied about Zeshia being
the Child of God,</i>

00:10:30.980 --> 00:10:33.070
<i>then that would mean there
are two Children of God.</i>

00:10:33.070 --> 00:10:35.400
<i>And that would violate the order of the Gods.</i>

00:10:35.900 --> 00:10:39.610
<i>There would only be no conflict
if Misa were the Child of God.</i>

00:10:39.910 --> 00:10:41.490
<i>But to negate that premise,</i>

00:10:42.280 --> 00:10:45.490
<i>there'd have to be the possibility that the Child of God
was someone other than these four...</i>

00:10:45.870 --> 00:10:48.870
<i>For example, if it were Lay,
then there'd be no conflict.</i>

00:10:49.420 --> 00:10:53.590
<i>At this point, it's certain that the Child of God
is one of my subordinates.</i>

00:10:53.590 --> 00:10:57.340
<i>It's either Misa, or someone other
than these four... but...</i>

00:10:57.720 --> 00:11:01.260
<i>This is too easy.
Why did you make Misa your "correct answer"?</i>

00:11:01.840 --> 00:11:06.600
<i>That would be meaningful if the Child of God
was among the three besides Misa.</i>

00:11:06.970 --> 00:11:09.100
<i>To let this contradiction stand...</i>

00:11:09.890 --> 00:11:12.770
The Child of God has the Demon Eyes of Destruction.

00:11:12.770 --> 00:11:14.060
Correct.

00:11:14.440 --> 00:11:15.690
<i>That fused body...</i>

00:11:18.820 --> 00:11:22.910
<i>It might have a true name that I'm unaware of.</i>

00:11:23.320 --> 00:11:28.000
<i>Of my subordinates, Sasha's the only one who
has the Demon Eyes of Destruction.</i>

00:11:28.450 --> 00:11:33.000
<i>Meaning that "the Child of God is Misa"
cannot be correct.</i>

00:11:33.290 --> 00:11:36.710
<i>In other words, you used your right
to lie for one or the other.</i>

00:11:36.710 --> 00:11:38.130
<i>You can no longer lie.</i>

00:11:39.300 --> 00:11:43.010
The Child of God is not a pure Demon,
but a half-spirit, half-demon.

00:11:43.340 --> 00:11:44.550
Wrong.

00:11:45.550 --> 00:11:47.600
<i>Meaning that it's not Misa.</i>

00:11:47.600 --> 00:11:50.770
<i>Which leaves that fused entity...
in other words...</i>

00:11:51.230 --> 00:11:53.440
I don't know the name
of the Child of God.

00:11:53.440 --> 00:11:54.980
Wrong.

00:11:55.230 --> 00:11:57.230
And now you're down to your final guess.

00:11:57.530 --> 00:12:02.610
Hmm. So the Child of God is my subordinate,
and though I do know the child's name,

00:12:02.610 --> 00:12:06.780
it's neither Misha, Sasha,
Misa, nor Zeshia.

00:12:06.990 --> 00:12:09.290
This is quite an entertaining battle of wits.

00:12:09.290 --> 00:12:13.290
Since the key to removing
the contradictions doesn't exist within the game.

00:12:13.790 --> 00:12:17.550
You've implanted a fake memory
into your own brain.

00:12:17.550 --> 00:12:20.670
I've been searching
for an answer that doesn't exist.

00:12:20.670 --> 00:12:22.130
So you're onto me!

00:12:22.130 --> 00:12:23.720
But it's too late!

00:12:26.640 --> 00:12:30.810
The moment you agreed to this battle of wits,
you'd already lost.

00:12:30.810 --> 00:12:34.850
Our Zecht bars you from attacking
my anti-magic barriers!

00:12:34.850 --> 00:12:36.610
But if you forfeit this match,

00:12:36.900 --> 00:12:39.190
your magical power
will be sealed for five seconds.

00:12:39.530 --> 00:12:41.360
Now, then, what will you do?

00:12:41.360 --> 00:12:43.320
I forfeit this match.

00:12:44.660 --> 00:12:46.240
You misjudged me, Demon King!

00:12:46.490 --> 00:12:51.540
Five! Four! Three! Two! One!

00:12:51.540 --> 00:12:52.830
It's all over now—

00:12:55.620 --> 00:13:00.000
Did you really think you could defeat me
just because you'd sealed my magical power?

00:13:03.420 --> 00:13:09.050
False or not, those memories were implanted
in you, with your genuine memories.

00:13:09.050 --> 00:13:11.560
There's always intent behind your actions.

00:13:11.890 --> 00:13:17.310
You didn't hesitate to destroy Melheis' source.
Instead of me.

00:13:17.860 --> 00:13:22.820
You might as well have told me
that killing Melheis was your top priority.

00:13:23.440 --> 00:13:28.120
Surely Melheis isn't worth much
to the Blaze Death King or the Heavenly Father God.

00:13:28.410 --> 00:13:31.490
Just annihilate me.
It may have been a mere battle of wits,

00:13:31.490 --> 00:13:34.290
but I can die having defeated
the Demon King of Tyranny.

00:13:34.290 --> 00:13:35.330
I have no regrets.

00:13:35.460 --> 00:13:39.170
Hmm... so says the Blaze Death King's army officer.

00:13:39.500 --> 00:13:45.880
Game or not, simply deluding yourself that you'd defeated
my lord is nothing short of disrespectful.

00:13:46.180 --> 00:13:47.300
What?

00:13:53.430 --> 00:13:55.850
I'll make sure that you don't suffer, at least.

00:13:56.980 --> 00:13:57.650
What?

00:14:01.480 --> 00:14:02.610
Move.

00:14:03.530 --> 00:14:06.650
You changed the Boundless Sword
the moment you touched it?

00:14:08.320 --> 00:14:11.740
Do you even know what
it is that you're creating?

00:14:12.080 --> 00:14:14.450
Curse you!

00:14:14.580 --> 00:14:17.330
This isn't possible... that castle...

00:14:17.330 --> 00:14:20.080
Delsgade is a god itself!

00:14:20.830 --> 00:14:23.000
How could a mere Demon...

00:14:23.920 --> 00:14:25.380
Have you awakened?

00:14:26.340 --> 00:14:29.130
I am... me.

00:14:32.300 --> 00:14:34.270
It's no use waiting, you know.

00:14:35.100 --> 00:14:40.770
If you smash one of Gennias' magic jewels,
the curse will destroy your source.

00:14:40.770 --> 00:14:43.230
So all I have to do is smash them all, right?

00:14:45.570 --> 00:14:49.490
You should watch your back around people
with more than two sources.

00:14:49.660 --> 00:14:52.030
Impossible...

00:14:53.080 --> 00:14:55.700
Seven sources?

00:14:56.200 --> 00:15:01.040
The Spirit God Sword Evansmana?

00:15:06.960 --> 00:15:10.050
Hmm? Can't hear you!

00:15:10.050 --> 00:15:12.260
Have you lost the strength to speak?

00:15:12.720 --> 00:15:17.850
I told you that I'd never forgive you!
Asc!

00:15:17.850 --> 00:15:18.930
It's useless.

00:15:19.600 --> 00:15:25.110
Since the emotions that you'd convert
into magical power can't be brought in here.

00:15:25.480 --> 00:15:30.110
You're wrong about that.
Emotions reside in the source.

00:15:30.910 --> 00:15:32.280
Huh?

00:15:33.620 --> 00:15:34.530
Eleonore!

00:15:35.990 --> 00:15:38.450
Wh-What did you say?
How did you—

00:15:39.910 --> 00:15:41.290
I created it.

00:15:41.830 --> 00:15:44.250
Just the desire inside my source.

00:15:45.630 --> 00:15:46.710
Impossible...

00:15:47.000 --> 00:15:48.420
Time for your punishment!

00:15:56.350 --> 00:15:59.560
Hero Kanon... you're alive?

00:16:06.230 --> 00:16:09.070
So you were born from a god after all.

00:16:09.690 --> 00:16:11.070
Ice Crystals.

00:16:11.320 --> 00:16:12.400
What...?

00:16:24.670 --> 00:16:26.420
I'm going to ask you one more time.

00:16:26.420 --> 00:16:28.710
Where did you get that half
of the Magic Sword?

00:16:28.920 --> 00:16:31.340
I cannot answer that.

00:16:36.260 --> 00:16:38.720
Was his source destroyed?

00:16:38.720 --> 00:16:41.180
No, looks like he's been reincarnated.

00:16:41.890 --> 00:16:44.100
The barriers... are gone.

00:16:44.100 --> 00:16:45.100
All right!

00:16:46.190 --> 00:16:47.650
Theo Ingal.

00:16:55.990 --> 00:16:58.660
No way, no way, no way.

00:16:58.660 --> 00:17:00.080
The Blaze Death King's powers...

00:17:00.450 --> 00:17:02.580
Defeated by Human Magic?

00:17:02.910 --> 00:17:05.460
The Blaze Death King may be incredible...

00:17:08.420 --> 00:17:10.880
But I'm the Demon King's magic!

00:17:22.560 --> 00:17:26.100
Misha?

00:17:26.400 --> 00:17:28.650
I was in time.

00:17:30.520 --> 00:17:32.030
Misha!

00:17:37.200 --> 00:17:38.990
How can you still be alive?

00:17:38.990 --> 00:17:42.500
You annihilated the fake that I'd switched out.

00:17:42.790 --> 00:17:45.960
Impossible!
That source was genuine!

00:17:45.960 --> 00:17:47.420
I saw it with my own eyes...

00:17:47.670 --> 00:17:49.500
It's a spell that I just learned recently.

00:17:49.500 --> 00:17:52.960
The Womb of Origination Magic,
Eleonore, created by the gods.

00:17:53.130 --> 00:17:56.760
Don't tell me you created a pseudo-source?

00:17:56.760 --> 00:17:59.680
Without even studying magic that much?

00:17:59.680 --> 00:18:03.520
If you did your research on me,
then you should've at least seen that.

00:18:03.720 --> 00:18:06.230
But when did you...?

00:18:10.610 --> 00:18:14.610
The moment you agreed to this battle of wits,
you'd already lost.

00:18:14.820 --> 00:18:20.200
No, I won't say that. The moment you thought
about battling me, you'd already lost.

00:18:24.660 --> 00:18:26.120
Suicide?

00:18:26.120 --> 00:18:27.790
Do you think I'd let him escape?

00:18:33.500 --> 00:18:37.630
You can't lie anymore.
Ziek, tell me your purpose for coming here.

00:18:37.800 --> 00:18:42.260
My purpose was to reduce even a little
of the Demon King of Tyranny's combat power.

00:18:42.760 --> 00:18:45.180
That's why I went after Melheis.

00:18:47.060 --> 00:18:53.690
So the people of Azeshion still believe in
and fear Avos Dilhevia?

00:18:53.860 --> 00:18:58.450
Yes. They seem to believe that Jerga's acts
of brutality in the recent war...

00:18:58.450 --> 00:19:02.450
...were the Demon King of Tyranny's doing.

00:19:02.450 --> 00:19:07.040
Though they're set to punish Diego,
who led the armed forces...

00:19:07.040 --> 00:19:10.420
Unless we act,
it could trigger another conflict, eh?

00:19:10.580 --> 00:19:13.250
I believe it would be wise
to announce that Avos is a fake...

00:19:13.250 --> 00:19:16.630
...during the ceremony of the Second Coming
of the Demon King.

00:19:16.880 --> 00:19:21.090
So our story will be that Kanon
and I joined forces to annihilate Avos?

00:19:21.390 --> 00:19:27.430
Yes. Although the Hero Kanon is thought
to have gone missing after the war.

00:19:27.430 --> 00:19:30.730
You should consider having him attend the ceremony.

00:19:34.230 --> 00:19:35.770
Sorry to keep you waiting.

00:19:35.770 --> 00:19:37.030
Are we all here?

00:19:37.360 --> 00:19:39.530
There's something I need you all to know.

00:19:39.530 --> 00:19:43.660
About the Child of God that we're searching for.
He or she might very well be one of you.

00:19:44.700 --> 00:19:49.410
The Scarlet Monument King's subordinate said
that she was created out of a god's intent.

00:19:49.410 --> 00:19:53.710
I don't know about any gods.
I am your child, Mommy.

00:19:54.080 --> 00:19:56.300
Nothing's been settled yet.

00:19:56.300 --> 00:20:02.050
They may be plotting to secretly awaken
the true Child of God while my eyes are on you.

00:20:02.470 --> 00:20:05.010
True. After all,
that's what the enemy says.

00:20:05.180 --> 00:20:09.680
Regarding that matter, I've received word
from the head of the Unitarians.

00:20:11.350 --> 00:20:14.770
I was told that no one knew his identity.
Who is it?

00:20:14.980 --> 00:20:19.190
The Demon King of Tyranny's right-hand man...
Shin Reglia.

00:20:20.110 --> 00:20:22.910
Shin, eh?
Why won't he show himself?

00:20:23.070 --> 00:20:25.200
I'm sure he has a good reason.

00:20:25.200 --> 00:20:31.370
He's sent word that he awaits you
in the Forest of Great Spirit Aharthern.

00:20:31.370 --> 00:20:34.960
Come to think of it, the King
of Curses' subordinate had this on him.

00:20:38.800 --> 00:20:40.090
I see.

00:20:48.220 --> 00:20:50.600
The Looting Sword Gilionojes, eh?

00:20:50.930 --> 00:20:53.440
I haven't seen it since
that day 2,000 years ago.

00:20:53.730 --> 00:20:55.100
It belongs to Shin Reglia, right?

00:20:56.270 --> 00:21:01.400
So the head of the Unitarians is Shin Reglia,
the owner of this sword?

00:21:01.400 --> 00:21:03.990
This is hard to understand.

00:21:03.990 --> 00:21:06.660
It's all right.
I don't get it, either!

00:21:06.950 --> 00:21:10.040
I wanted to inform you sooner, Lord Anos,

00:21:10.040 --> 00:21:13.000
but I was unable to detect you
or your magical power.

00:21:13.210 --> 00:21:14.210
Right.

00:21:14.210 --> 00:21:17.130
These days I've been really into renovating
the underground dungeon.

00:21:17.130 --> 00:21:19.710
Underground?
You mean Delsgade?

00:21:19.710 --> 00:21:22.050
Why would you do something like that?

00:21:22.050 --> 00:21:24.840
I built a city where
the 10,000 Zeshias can live.

00:21:25.010 --> 00:21:26.720
A city?

00:21:26.720 --> 00:21:29.470
And thanks to you,
they all seem to be enjoying themselves!

00:21:29.890 --> 00:21:32.640
You shouldn't be building something
so outrageous.

00:21:32.810 --> 00:21:36.020
Lord Anos,
what are you going to do now?

00:21:36.190 --> 00:21:40.860
I'll be heading to Aharthern.
The Great Spirit Leno should be there, as well.

00:21:41.650 --> 00:21:45.030
But we can't take our eyes off NousGalia, can we?

00:21:45.150 --> 00:21:49.950
Not only that, but it's possible
that he might be targeting them.

00:21:49.950 --> 00:21:54.080
We're just going to have to all go together.
Needless to say, that includes NousGalia.

00:21:54.080 --> 00:21:55.410
How are we going to do that?

00:21:55.790 --> 00:21:58.380
Gods always keep their promises to Humans.

00:21:58.380 --> 00:22:00.790
Surely, he can't disobey an order.

00:22:00.790 --> 00:22:04.590
Our next class will be a field trip to Aharthern.

00:23:35.810 --> 00:23:40.020
THE SPIRIT'S SCHOOL BUILDING

00:23:36.770 --> 00:23:38.560
The Spirit's School Building.
